our printer.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                        =
        &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                           =
     &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                               =
     &lt;p&gt;Then, tap on the Add button.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                =
